{"1898500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Worldless", "steam_appid": 1898500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2546820], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worldless unfolds in a newborn universe where entities are locked in an eternal conflict fueled by the polarizing nature of their attractions. These encounters can trigger an unstable exchange of polarities with transformations that are unpredictable and full of mysterious consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this stylized 2D  platformer, you will explore intricate and interconnected realms brimming with secrets and mysteries. Master a rich set of abilities such as dashing and wall jumping to traverse these abstract landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you will face beings determined to stop you as you search for your place within this universe. Battles blend classic turn based strategy with real time action elements, demanding deep knowledge of  mechanics for a thrilling and strategic combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898500/extras/cbe5dee8318de973eb5692186c88cfb9.webp?t=1788255568\" width=780 height=25 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover unimaginable possibilities by dashing, jumping, and weaving through surreal environments on a quest for transcendence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898500/extras/218494041517f7e3dbe29ec10a3411d4.poster.avif?t=1788255568\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1898500/extras/21849404151